sentences.t:
Wæs þæt beorhte bold tōbrocen swīðe
eal inneweard īrẹnbendum fæst,
heorras tōhlidene;

Bugon þā tō bence blǣdāgande,
fylle gefǣgon, fægere geþǣgon
medoful manig;

Forgeaf þā Bēowulfe bearn Healfdenes
segen gyldenne sigores tō lēane,
hroden hiltcumbor, helm ond byrnan;

Heht ðā eorla hlēo eahta mēaras
fǣtedhlēore on flet teôn,
in under eoderas;

Ond ðā Bēowulfe bēga gehwæþres
eodor Ingwina onweald getēah,
wicga ond wǣpna;
